      "text": "The lock is shaped like an Auren rune. Old Tobb says the Auren threw their keys into Mirror Lake; maybe the lake still has this one.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Leave it."
        }
      ]
    },
    "closed": {
      "text": "An old iron-bound chest with a lock of white stone set in its lid, cut like a rune. No pick will turn it; it wants its own key.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Open it.",
          "effects": [
            {
              "take": {
                "item": "drowned_key",
                "count": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "setFlag": "cache.cache_archive_vault"
            },
            {
              "gold": 220
            },
            {
              "give": {
                "item": "rune_core",
                "count": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "give": {
                "item": "healing_potion",
                "count": 2
              }
            }
          ],
          "next": "found"
        },
        {
          "text": "Leave it."
        }
      ]
    },
    "found": {
      "text": "Inside, wrapped in oilcloth: the Archive's last treasury: Auren silver, a rune core and two flasks of a healer's draught, sealed in wax.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Take it all."
        }
      ]
    },
    "empty": {
      "text": "The chest stands open and empty. Someone got here first. You did.",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Leave"
